              </?01M05F1PCG392E67NEG7JDJWB8>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T3.2" name = "定义 shell 与 support adoption 边界" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PCG392E67NEG7JDJWB9>
            明确 terminal/tui/headless 仅消费装配结果与 capability ports，support 实现按平台/AI 归位。
            </?01M05F1PCG392E67NEG7JDJWB9>
            <Acceptance [
